      "id": "claim_ac84dfed0ede4d3aaba455628207bdf9",
      "statement": "A failed call touches a marker file under instance/tv_down and a background call is refused immediately with FrameTVUnavailableError while that file is younger than the cooldown, 30 seconds by default; a success deletes the marker, and the file makes the cooldown shared between worker processes.",
